Package: sdlrm
Type: Package
Title: Modified Skew Discrete Laplace Regression for Integer-Valued and Paired Discrete Data
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Rodrigo", "Medeiros",
    email = "rodrigo.matheus@ufrn.br",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implementation of the modified SDL regression model. The package provides a set
    of functions for a complete analysis of integer-valued data, where the dependent variable
    is assumed to follow a modified skew discrete Laplace (SDL) distribution. This regression
    model is useful for the analysis of integer-valued data and experimental studies in which
    paired discrete observations are collected.
URL: https://github.com/rdmatheus/sdlrm
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports: 
    Formula (>= 1.2.3),
    Rfast
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
